      "text": "ordains Joseph Smith and Oliver Cowdery to Aaronic Priesthood, D&C 13 (27:8). birth of John the Baptist foretold by Elias, D&C 27:7. filled with spirit of Elias, D&C 27:7. sent to restore Aaronic Priesthood, D&C 27:8. Sidney Rigdon sent forth even as John, D&C 35:4. law of carnal commandments continued until John, D&C 84:27. baptized in childhood and ordained when eight days old, D&C 84:28. John’s record to be revealed, D&C 93:6, 18. John saw and bore record of fulness of Christ’s glory, D&C 93:6–17.",
